{"id":3224,"slug":"3224-cach-tao-va-dung-pinia-store","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"Pinia","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"Cách tạo và dùng Pinia store?","question_en":"How to create and use a Pinia store?","answer_vi":"Pinia stores được tạo với `defineStore()` dùng setup-store syntax (khuyến nghị), trả về refs cho state, computed getters, và action functions.\n```javascript\n// stores/counter.ts\nimport { defineStore } from 'pinia'\nimport { ref, computed } from 'vue'\n\nexport const useCounterStore = defineStore('counter', () => {\n  const count = ref(0)\n  const double = computed(() => count.value * 2)\n\n  function increment() { count.value++ }\n  function reset() { count.value = 0 }\n\n  return { count, double, increment, reset }\n})\n```\n```javascript\n// Trong component\nimport { useCounterStore } from '@/stores/counter'\nconst store = useCounterStore()\nstore.increment()\nconsole.log(store.count, store.double)\n```\nLưu ý: destructure store mất reactivity — dùng `storeToRefs`: `const { count, double } = storeToRefs(store)` (methods thì destructure thường).","answer_en":"Use `defineStore()` with setup-store syntax (recommended) — refs become state, computed values become getters, functions become actions.\n```javascript\n// stores/counter.ts\nimport { defineStore } from 'pinia'\nimport { ref, computed } from 'vue'\n\nexport const useCounterStore = defineStore('counter', () => {\n  const count = ref(0)\n  const double = computed(() => count.value * 2)\n\n  function increment() { count.value++ }\n  function reset() { count.value = 0 }\n\n  return { count, double, increment, reset }\n})\n```\n```javascript\n// In component\nimport { useCounterStore } from '@/stores/counter'\nconst store = useCounterStore()\nstore.increment()\nconsole.log(store.count, store.double)\n```\nPitfall: destructuring store loses reactivity — use `storeToRefs`: `const { count, double } = storeToRefs(store)` (methods can be destructured normally).","answer_html_vi":"<p>Pinia stores được tạo với <code>defineStore()</code> dùng setup-store syntax (khuyến nghị), trả về refs cho state, computed getters, và action functions.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// stores/counter.ts\nimport { defineStore } from 'pinia'\nimport { ref, computed } from 'vue'\n\nexport const useCounterStore = defineStore('counter', () =&gt; {\n  const count = ref(0)\n  const double = computed(() =&gt; count.value * 2)\n\n  function increment() { count.value++ }\n  function reset() { count.value = 0 }\n\n  return { count, double, increment, reset }\n})\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// stores/counter.ts</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { defineStore } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;pinia&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { ref, computed } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> useCounterStore = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">defineStore</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;counter&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> count = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ref</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> double = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">computed</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> count.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span> * <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>)\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">increment</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) { count.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>++ }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reset</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) { count.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> }\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> { count, double, increment, reset }\n})</code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// Trong component\nimport { useCounterStore } from '@/stores/counter'\nconst store = useCounterStore()\nstore.increment()\nconsole.log(store.count, store.double)\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Trong component</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { useCounterStore } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@/stores/counter&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> store = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useCounterStore</span>()\nstore.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">increment</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(store.<span class=\"hljs-property\">count</span>, store.<span class=\"hljs-property\">double</span>)</code></pre></div><p>Lưu ý: destructure store mất reactivity — dùng <code>storeToRefs</code>: <code>const { count, double } = storeToRefs(store)</code> (methods thì destructure thường).</p>","answer_html_en":"<p>Use <code>defineStore()</code> with setup-store syntax (recommended) — refs become state, computed values become getters, functions become actions.</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// stores/counter.ts\nimport { defineStore } from 'pinia'\nimport { ref, computed } from 'vue'\n\nexport const useCounterStore = defineStore('counter', () =&gt; {\n  const count = ref(0)\n  const double = computed(() =&gt; count.value * 2)\n\n  function increment() { count.value++ }\n  function reset() { count.value = 0 }\n\n  return { count, double, increment, reset }\n})\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// stores/counter.ts</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { defineStore } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;pinia&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { ref, computed } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;vue&#x27;</span>\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">export</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> useCounterStore = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">defineStore</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;counter&#x27;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> count = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">ref</span>(<span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> double = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">computed</span>(<span class=\"hljs-function\">() =&gt;</span> count.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span> * <span class=\"hljs-number\">2</span>)\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">increment</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) { count.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span>++ }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reset</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\"></span>) { count.<span class=\"hljs-property\">value</span> = <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> }\n\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span> { count, double, increment, reset }\n})</code></pre></div><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"// In component\nimport { useCounterStore } from '@/stores/counter'\nconst store = useCounterStore()\nstore.increment()\nconsole.log(store.count, store.double)\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// In component</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">import</span> { useCounterStore } <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">from</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;@/stores/counter&#x27;</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> store = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useCounterStore</span>()\nstore.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">increment</span>()\n<span class=\"hljs-variable language_\">console</span>.<span class=\"hljs-title function_\">log</span>(store.<span class=\"hljs-property\">count</span>, store.<span class=\"hljs-property\">double</span>)</code></pre></div><p>Pitfall: destructuring store loses reactivity — use <code>storeToRefs</code>: <code>const { count, double } = storeToRefs(store)</code> (methods can be destructured normally).</p>","references":[],"related":[{"url":"/q/3223-pinia-la-gi-tai-sao-thay-the-vuex","title":"Pinia là gì? Tại sao thay thế Vuex?"},{"url":"/q/3225-storetorefs-la-gi-tai-sao-can","title":"`storeToRefs` là gì? Tại sao cần?"},{"url":"/q/3226-persist-pinia-store-voi-localstorage","title":"Persist Pinia store với localStorage?"},{"url":"/q/3200-vue-js-la-gi-khac-react-angular-the-nao","title":"Vue.js là gì? Khác React/Angular thế nào?"},{"url":"/q/3201-options-api-vs-composition-api-khac-nhau-gi","title":"Options API vs Composition API — khác nhau gì?"},{"url":"/q/3202-script-setup-la-gi-loi-ich-so-voi-setup-thong-thuong","title":"`<script setup>` là gì? Lợi ích so với `setup()` thông thường?"},{"url":"/q/3204-single-file-component-sfc-la-gi","title":"Single File Component (SFC) là gì?"},{"url":"/q/3205-cac-directive-pho-bien-trong-vue-v-if-v-show-v-for-v-model-v-bind-v-on","title":"Các directive phổ biến trong Vue: v-if, v-show, v-for, v-model, v-bind, v-on?"}]}